t includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 27.0 inches a year. The wettest year was 2007 (37.81 in); the driest, 2022 (13.27 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 10 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}